    "description": "NCEI Accession 0108159 includes Surface underway data collected from ODEN in the South Atlantic Ocean, South Pacific Ocean and Southern Oceans (> 60 degrees South) from 2006-12-14 to 2006-12-26. These data include Partial pressure (or fugacity) of carbon dioxide - water, SALINITY and SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURE. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer and Shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.\n\nThese data were collected by Agneta Fransson and Melissa Chierici of Norwegian Polar Institute as part of the Oden_77DNOSO_2006 data set. CDIAC associated the following cruise ID(s) with this data set: 77DNOSO",
